2. use the most appropriate method to improve the fitness level;
3. describe the basic concepts of physical fitness;
4. administer the fitness testing and interpret the results accordingly;
5. design the plan of exercise prescription on different fitness components in accordance with the basic principles (including weight management);
6. demonstrate positive attitudes and values toward lifelong participation in physical activities.

